	text: [
		"To further gain more §6Observations§r and §6Theories§r, different types of §6Teas§r are required.",
		"",
		"Each tea has a specific school of knowledge associated with it (shown in its tooltip), and each tea also provides §6Fundamental§r knowledge. ",
		"",
		"While the Tea effect is active, and your inventory contains §6Scribing Tools§r and the §6Thaumonomicon§r, you will automatically gain knowledge over time. ",
		"",
		"The §6speed§r at which you gain knowledge can be further §6improved§r by surrounding yourself with §6inspiring§r things, providing a §6wellness bonus§r.",
		"",
		"Once you drink the tea, the current wellness bonus will be shown in §6chat§r. ",
		"",
		"This bonus is §6active§r even if you §6leave§r your inspiring surroundings, until the potion effect §6runs out§r."
